n\nThis seems to be an bug in gdscript analyzer, and it's not project-specified. any simple script could be used to reproduce this.\n\nin my case,\n\n```gdscript\nextends Node\n\nenum State {\n\tIDLE,\n\tWALK,\n\tDEAD\n}\n\nvar cur_state :State = State.IDLE\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tmatch cur_state:\n\t\tState.IDLE:\n\t\t\t# ...\n\t\t\tpass\n\t\tState.WALK:\n\t\t\t# ...\n\t\t\tpass\n\t\tState.DEAD:\n\t\t\t# ...\n\t\t\tpass\n\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101587/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101587/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}